                "text": "Andrew Cuomo never told the truth about what happened inside of the nursing homes during COVID which led to the deaths of elderly people across NY. \n\nHis decision to send patients who tested positive into nursing homes was one of the most disastrous decisions made during the pandemic and I look forward to demanding answers for their families.",
