                "text": "TBI is all too common for our military servicemembers and veterans and new research shows TBI patients face increased risks. Researchers at WRAIR and the VA are exploring new potential treatment options and it is critical that this program is adequately funded. Our military service members and veterans deserve the best care possible. Read the letter we sent below! \u2b07\ufe0f",
