                "text": "Gov. Cuomo wouldn\u2019t even apologize to the families who are sitting right behind him who lost family members due to the negligent directive to move 6,326 COVID-19 patients back into nursing homes while denying them the ability to test these patients for COVID prior to admittance. https://t.co/gD1dowt05o",
