                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "TODAY, I voted YES on H.R. 27, the HALT Fentanyl Act, which @RepMGriffith and @boblatta introduced.\n\nAs an ER physician, I have seen firsthand what fentanyl does to the body. I have treated too many young patients who have overdosed, and America has lost too many lives to this crisis. This was a no-brainer to vote yes to HALT Fentanyl.",
