                "reply_count": 6,
                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As a physician, I have seen firsthand how the opioid crisis is tearing families apart, and we are taking action. I am proud to announce that we passed H.R. 2483 \u2013 the SUPPORT for Patients and Communities Reauthorization Act, which renews vital programs to prevent overdoses, treat addiction, and support recovery efforts.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nHouse Republicans are delivering common-sense solutions to protect our communities and save lives.",
