                "text": "Socialism fails every time. Since Democrats pushed the country toward a more socialist-style healthcare system through the \u201cUnaffordable\u201d Care Act, costs have only risen. This year alone, premiums jumped 26%. It\u2019s time to move away from socialist policies and pursue a new approach to healthcare.",
